cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference PHP Shield in academic or technical writing, cite it as below."
title: "PHP Shield: modular request firewall for PHP"
abstract: >-
  A request firewall for PHP applications: local detection of SQL injection, XSS, command
  injection, path traversal, file inclusion and scanner signatures; IPv4/IPv6 reputation from
  AbuseIPDB.com and AbuseIPDB.ru with cache and circuit breaker; per-address rate limiting on MySQL
  or Redis; severity-based IP blocking with an incident journal and an admin dashboard.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/paulmann/PHP-Shield"
url: "https://github.com/paulmann/PHP-Shield"
version: "2.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
keywords:
